{
	"Name": "Okta - Authentication & Sessions - Multiple Okta Sessions for One User from Different IPs",
	"Description": "Alert: Okta\nGroup: Authentication & Sessions\nMITRE ATT&CK: Lateral Movement / T1550.004\nSchedule: every 15 minutes over the previous 15 minutes (edit the scheduled search to change it)\nTuning: okta_user_allowlist / okta_ip_allowlist keys \"<login without domain>|Multiple Okta Sessions for One User from Different IPs\" or \"<ip>|Multiple Okta Sessions for One User from Different IPs\"\n\nTwo or more new Okta sessions (user.session.start SUCCESS) for one user from two or more different IP addresses within the search window. One alert per user and IP.\n\nFalse positives: a user switching between office and mobile networks within minutes.\n\nReference(s):\n- https://detection.fyi/elastic/detection-rules/integrations/okta/lateral_movement_multiple_sessions_for_single_user/\n- https://github.com/elastic/detection-rules/tree/main/rules/integrations/okta/lateral_movement_multiple_sessions_for_single_user.toml",
	"GUID": "cd334285-a6f7-5a99-a44f-1ab1f2c542e1",
